OL,3,GNEWSA'Bleak' future for rugby club as
OL,4,Aplayer numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rugby club is struggling to survive
OL,7,Fafter 52 years due to a lack of
OL,8,Fplayers.
OL,10,FLlanybydder Rugby Club in
OL,11,FCarmarthenshire has been struggling to
OL,12,Ffind enough players to field a team
OL,13,Feach week, with player Wyn Davies, 30,
OL,14,Fsaying it is "quite difficult to take
OL,15,Fin".
OL,17,FClub manager Nia Evans has urged the
OL,18,FWelsh Rugby Union (WRU) to give more
OL,19,Fsupport to grassroots clubs because
OL,20,F"that's where all the rugby players
OL,21,Fcome from".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
